 "notes": "Natural S08 ambient (bg_natural/S08.webp, master v3 2026-10-06: the pump-track hill on the far side of the pond): clouds drifting over the big sky (sky mask following the hill's skyline), ripples and glints on the pale pond, two ducks swimming slowly on the pond (water mask), wind in the dry reeds on both shores, three children riding the pump track one way round (a girl and a boy on balance bikes, an older boy on a BMX; style-A sprites art/ambient/s08_riders.png keyed into S08/natural/rider_*_sheet, on-screen size, pivot at the wheels) along the traced centre line of the painted track, from the end of the left banked turn's upper strand through the turn, over the rollers and the crest, down the switchback and round the right berm; they fade in and out where the painted track ends in the grass; the rusty ferns at the railing and the dry grass left of the bench (the ball's spot is excluded from the fern cut, so nothing brings the ball back after Q1B), a few leaves blowing across the trail, birds over the fields. Nobody near the walk band. Cut-outs: art/ambient/natural/S08.cuts.json -> assets/ambient/S08/natural/.",
